{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03729","headline":"奉和幸大荐福寺应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和幸大荐福寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁沼开香域，鹦林降彩旃。\n还窥图凤宇，更坐跃龙川。\n桂轝朝羣辟，兰宫列四禅。\n半空银阁断，分砌宝绳连。\n甘雨苏燋泽，慈云动沛篇。\n独慙贤作砺，空喜福成田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}